  message: "Premise re-check 2026-10-25 on dev 16534a75f7 (production-CLI repros on tiny fixtures unless marked code read). CURRENT, refs drifted (code read). ContentRule.ecosystem discovery.py:925-939: 85 rules carry 41 distinct values plus the 'git submodule' rule, 42 in all (not ~45); branched on as a display label at :1845; re-emitted as tool at :1875 and supply_chain.py:1538. ADR-0041 §3 (:66-70) owns 'ecosystem' as stdlib/third_party, so the rename to tool stands. channel_kind's example 'message_queue' (axis_meta_keys.py:564-566) still has no producer -- producers emit exactly crdt, ipc, message_bus, queue, websocket; the spec (:1231, :1263) is already right, only the registry example is wrong; Phoenix 'ipc' at phoenix_ipc.py:358. The keep-with-trigger half (generic Edge.meta keys call_type axis_meta_keys.py:1488, method :1596) overlaps WI-kuhoh (open, owner decision pending) and defers to it; grep found no edge reader. P4 kept."  # 5339
